---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: delivery.html
title: 납품실적
description: 전국의 교량과 도로 현장에 공급한 하이탑 교량이음장치 대표 납품실적을 소개합니다.
bodyClass: bg-surface text-ink
---

<section class="relative mt-20 h-[36vh] min-h-[280px] max-h-[380px] overflow-hidden bg-night">
  <picture class="absolute inset-0 block h-full w-full">
    <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="{{ '/images/delivery/joint-installation.jpg' | url }}">
    <img src="{{ '/images/delivery/joint-complete.jpg' | url }}" alt="교량이음장치 설치 및 시공 현장"
         class="h-full w-full object-cover object-[center_42%]" width="1400" height="1050" fetchpriority="high">
  </picture>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-night/48"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-44 bg-gradient-to-t from-night/75 to-transparent"></div>

  <div class="container-hi relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col justify-end pb-9 text-white sm:pb-11">
    <nav aria-label="브레드크럼" class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-white/60">
      <a href="{{ '/' | url }}" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">홈</a>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true">chevron_right</span>
      <span aria-current="page" class="text-white/90">납품실적</span>
    </nav>
    <span class="eyebrow-line !text-white/60">Project Reference</span>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white [text-shadow:0_2px_18px_rgba(11,14,19,0.45)] sm:text-4xl">납품실적</h1>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ 공개 실적 요약 ══ -->
<section class="border-b border-line bg-white py-14 lg:py-20">
  <div class="container-hi">
    <div class="grid items-end gap-7 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <span class="eyebrow-line">Delivery Record</span>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-4xl">현장과 규격으로 확인하는 납품 이력</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="border-t border-ink/15 pt-5 leading-relaxed text-secondary lg:col-span-5">
        홈페이지에 공개된 대표 실적을 기준으로 발주기관과 현장명, 적용 모델을 정리했습니다.
        아래 목록에서 기관·현장·제품 규격을 직접 검색할 수 있습니다.
      </p>
    </div>

    <dl class="mt-10 grid border-y border-ink/15 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-4 border-b border-line py-6 sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r sm:pr-7">
        <dt class="text-sm font-bold text-secondary">공개 대표 현장</dt>
        <dd class="font-display text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-primary">{{ products.delivery.length }}</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-4 border-b border-line py-6 sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r sm:px-7">
        <dt class="text-sm font-bold text-secondary">발주기관</dt>
        <dd class="font-display text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-primary">{{ products.deliveryMeta.clientCount }}</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-4 py-6 sm:pl-7">
        <dt class="text-sm font-bold text-secondary">적용 규격</dt>
        <dd class="font-display text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-primary">{{ products.deliveryMeta.modelCount }}</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ 납품현장 목록 ══ -->
<section class="section container-hi" data-delivery-index>
  <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-14">
    <div class="lg:col-span-4">
      <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28">
        <span class="eyebrow-line">Project Index</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold text-ink">대표 납품현장</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-secondary">
          발주기관, 현장명 또는 제품 규격으로 실적을 검색할 수 있습니다.
        </p>

        <label class="delivery-search mt-8 flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-ink/30 pb-3 transition-colors focus-within:border-accent">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl text-secondary" aria-hidden="true">search</span>
          <span class="sr-only">납품현장 검색</span>
          <input type="search" placeholder="발주기관 · 현장명 · 규격 검색"
                 class="min-w-0 flex-1 bg-transparent text-sm text-ink outline-none placeholder:text-secondary/60"
                 data-delivery-search>
        </label>

        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2" aria-label="제품군 필터" data-delivery-filters>
          <button type="button" class="filter-pill is-active" data-delivery-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">전체</button>
          <button type="button" class="filter-pill" data-delivery-filter="NFJ" aria-pressed="false">New Finger</button>
          <button type="button" class="filter-pill" data-delivery-filter="NMC" aria-pressed="false">Monocell</button>
          <button type="button" class="filter-pill" data-delivery-filter="SFJ" aria-pressed="false">Steel Finger</button>
          <button type="button" class="filter-pill" data-delivery-filter="RAIL" aria-pressed="false">Rail Seal</button>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 flex items-baseline gap-2 border-t border-line pt-5">
          <span class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary" data-delivery-count>{{ products.delivery.length }}</span>
          <span class="text-sm text-secondary">개 현장 표시</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-8" data-delivery-list>
      <div class="hidden grid-cols-[3.5rem_minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.3fr)_auto] gap-5 border-b border-ink/25 pb-3 font-display text-[0.62rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-secondary/70 md:grid">
        <span>No.</span>
        <span>Client</span>
        <span>Project</span>
        <span>Model</span>
      </div>

      {% for project in products.delivery %}
        <article class="group grid gap-3 border-b border-line py-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-ink/30 md:grid-cols-[3.5rem_minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.3fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-5"
                 data-delivery-row
                 data-models="{{ project.models | join(' ') }}"
                 data-search="{{ project.client }} {{ project.site }} {{ project.models | join(' ') }}">
          <span class="font-display text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-ink/25 transition-colors group-hover:text-accent">{% if loop.index < 10 %}0{% endif %}{{ loop.index }}</span>
          <p class="text-sm font-bold leading-relaxed text-ink">{{ project.client }}</p>
          <h3 class="text-[0.95rem] font-semibold leading-relaxed text-ink/85">{{ project.site }}</h3>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 md:max-w-[180px] md:justify-end">
            {% for model in project.models %}
              <span class="delivery-model">{{ model }}</span>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}

      <div class="hidden border-b border-line py-16 text-center" data-delivery-empty>
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl text-secondary/50" aria-hidden="true">search_off</span>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-bold text-ink">검색 결과가 없습니다</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-secondary">다른 발주기관, 현장명 또는 규격으로 검색해 보세요.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 flex items-start gap-3 rounded-lg bg-section px-5 py-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-secondary">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined mt-px text-base text-primary" aria-hidden="true">info</span>
        <p>홈페이지 공개용 대표 납품실적입니다. 세부 납품 내역과 현장 조건별 적용 제품은 별도로 문의해 주세요.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set ctaTitle = "현장에 맞는 제품이 필요하신가요?" %}
{% set ctaDesc = "교량 형식과 유간, 신축량을 알려주시면 적합한 제품과 규격을 안내해 드립니다." %}
{% set ctaSecondary = { label: "제품 상세보기", url: "/products-bridge.html" } %}
{% include "partials/cta-band.njk" %}
